{"id":"n59531-3-10","stage":0,"title":"보이다 · 给看","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59531-3-10-1","ko":"신호 위반입니다. 면허증을 보여 주십시오.","zh":"您违反了交通信号规则，请出示您的驾照。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"신호","meaning":"信号","explanation":"신호：信号","readings":[{"term":"신호","audio":"/audio/617aa217dbc92e8aaffc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66278","senseId":"3","lemma":"신호","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신호","audio":"/audio/617aa217dbc92e8aaffc.mp3"}},{"text":"위반입니다.","meaning":"违反，违背","explanation":"위반：违反，违背；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"위반","audio":"/audio/8babdb5c9618a214bed6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69576","senseId":"1","lemma":"위반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"위반입니다","audio":"/audio/be50b2a8b2959d952c3a.mp3"}},{"text":"면허증을","meaning":"许可证，执照，驾照","explanation":"면허증：许可证，执照，驾照；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"면허증","audio":"/audio/cdb62070fd9d864223eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55083","senseId":"1","lemma":"면허증","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"면허증을","audio":"/audio/d7a7bb6d6abe2ee547b9.mp3"}},{"text":"보여","meaning":"给看","explanation":"보이다：给看；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59531","senseId":"3","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보여","audio":"/audio/f30cd240679cd06f7fad.mp3"}},{"text":"주십시오.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㅂ시오：正式敬语的请求或命令语尾；通常与시合成십시오。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주십시오","audio":"/audio/ad438958813cf7714294.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"617aa217dbc92e8a","term":"신호","zh":"信号","audio":"/audio/617aa217dbc92e8aaffc.mp3","entryId":"66278","definition":"告知发生某事或将发生某事。","pronunciation":["신ː호"]},{"id":"8babdb5c9618a214","term":"위반","zh":"违反，违背","audio":"/audio/8babdb5c9618a214bed6.mp3","entryId":"69576","definition":"不遵守法律、命令、约定等。","pronunciation":["위반"]},{"id":"cdb62070fd9d8642","term":"면허증","zh":"许可证，执照，驾照","audio":"/audio/cdb62070fd9d864223eb.mp3","entryId":"55083","definition":"由国家机关颁发的证明特定领域技术的证书。","pronunciation":["면ː허쯩"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"给看","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"59531","definition":"为了解对象的内容或状态而使对方仔细察看。","pronunciation":["보이다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/43ebe0402c8ad2c6125c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n59531-3-10-2","ko":"여기 제 운전 면허증이 있어요.","zh":"这是我的驾驶执照。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}},{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}},{"text":"운전","meaning":"驾驶，操纵，开","explanation":"운전：驾驶，操纵，开","readings":[{"term":"운전","audio":"/audio/5d97578a4a83b40e2ef4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69304","senseId":"1","lemma":"운전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운전","audio":"/audio/5d97578a4a83b40e2ef4.mp3"}},{"text":"면허증이","meaning":"许可证，执照，驾照","explanation":"면허증：许可证，执照，驾照；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"면허증","audio":"/audio/cdb62070fd9d864223eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55083","s